``` Brute-force login attempts
    MITRE ATT&CK T1110
    Source: Windows Security 4625 ```
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count AS failed_attempts dc(TargetUserName) AS distinct_users values(TargetUserName) AS users BY _time, src_ip
| where failed_attempts >= 10
| sort - failed_attempts
